    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">

        <span class="eyebrow">Optical Communications</span>

        <h1>Learn How Information Travels Through Light</h1>

        <p>
          Explore optical fibers, transmitters, receivers, modulation,
          multiplexing, link budgets, and optical communication-system
          analysis.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Learning Topics</span>
            <h2>Optical communication fundamentals</h2>
          </div>

          <p>
            Begin with the basic optical link and progress toward modern
            high-speed fiber-optic communication systems.
          </p>
        </div>


        <div class="grid-3">
<a
  href="optical-link-fundamentals/"
  class="card-link"
  aria-label="Explore Optical Link Fundamentals"
>
  <article class="card">
    <div class="card-icon">↔</div>

    <h3>Optical Link Fundamentals</h3>

    <p>
      Learn how transmitters, optical fibers, and receivers work together
      to carry information.
    </p>

    <span class="status-label available">
      Explore Topic
    </span>
  </article>
</a>
                <a
            href="eye-diagrams/"
            class="card-link"
            aria-label="Explore Eye Diagrams"
          >
            <article class="card">
              <div class="card-icon">◉</div>

              <h3>Eye Diagrams</h3>

              <p>
                Learn how eye diagrams reveal signal quality, noise,
                timing jitter, intersymbol interference, rise and fall
                times, and receiver noise margin.
              </p>

              <span class="status-label available">
                Explore Topic
              </span>
            </article>
          </a>

          
        <a
  href="optical-transmitters/"
  class="card-link"
  aria-label="Explore Optical Transmitters"
>
  <article class="card">
    <div class="card-icon">Tx</div>

    <h3>Optical Transmitters</h3>

    <p>
      Explore lasers, LEDs, optical modulators, wavelength, power,
      and transmitter characteristics.
    </p>

    <span class="status-label available">
      Explore Topic
    </span>
  </article>
</a>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">Rx</div>
            <h3>Optical Receivers</h3>
            <p>
              Study photodetectors, receiver sensitivity, noise,
              photodetection, and signal recovery.
            </p>
          </article>

<a
  href="optical-transceivers/"
  class="card-link"
  aria-label="Explore Optical Transceivers"
>
  <article class="card">
    <div class="card-icon">Tx/Rx</div>

    <h3>Optical Transceivers</h3>

    <p>
      Explore optical transceiver architecture, form factors, host interfaces,
      optical interfaces, IEEE standards, and multi-source agreements.
    </p>

    <span class="status-label available">
      Explore Topic
    </span>
  </article>
</a>
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">λ</div>
            <h3>Multiplexing</h3>
            <p>
              Understand wavelength-, time-, and space-division
              multiplexing techniques.
            </p>
          </article>


          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-icon">dB</div>
            <h3>Optical Link Budget</h3>
            <p>
              Calculate optical power, fiber loss, connector loss,
              system margin, and maximum transmission distance.
            </p>
          </article>


    <a href="bit-error-rate/" class="card-link">
  <article class="card">
    <div class="card-icon">BER</div>

    <h3>System Performance</h3>

    <p>
      Examine bit-error rate, eye diagrams, dispersion,
      bandwidth, and communication-system performance.
    </p>
